---
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <Navbar nav_suffix="/ about" />

  <PageLayout>
    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">who am i ?</h1>
    <br />

    <p class="text-neutral-300">
      I am just an ordinary kid who accidentally got this hands on a keyboard
      and that event just changed his life in a positive way. I love the feeling
      of making something that helps you in your real world or just when you get
      a wierd idea and then you actually make and it actually works, that's what
      drives me to code.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">do you know about hackclub ?</h1>
    <br />
    <p class="text-neutral-300">
      i have been a part of <a href="https://hackclub.com">Hackclub</a> for about
      an year and attended two international events, first one in <a
        href="https://shiba.hackclub.com">Japan</a
      > which just changed my perspective about how fun the real world can be and
      super smart people are usually a pretty chill person when you meet them,i'll
      post a blog about this (dm me for this and i may do it sooner lol). second event
      was in <a href="https://arcana.hackclub.com/">Singapore</a> (2 weeks before
      writing this page) and this event was amazing too. before joining hackclub.
      i used to be a pretty active guy on x/twitter , talking to cool nerdy people
      and challenging myself to compete with them.
    </p>

    <br />
    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold">what do i do now ?</h1>
    <br />

    <p class="text-neutral-300">
      I am currently pursuing a BTech CSE degree in a university. for more
      specific now details, see my <a href="/now">now page</a>.
    </p>
  </PageLayout>
</Layout>
